  vendorName: Director Ashford
  offerText: Your recreational lounge chair is entirely inefficient. Let my team
    haul it away immediately. I will pay you handsomely.
  acceptResultText: The team hauls away your beloved chair and hands you a fat stack
    of bills. The room is spacious and your wallet is thick, but sitting on the hard,
    cold floor makes you utterly miserable.
  rejectResultText: You stubbornly keep the chair. An hour later, an internal spring
    violently snaps upward, stabbing you in the back and leaving you in agonizing
    pain.
